Package: RBanomaly
Title: Record-Breaking Anomaly Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xiaoxiang", "Guan", email = "guan@gfz.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculate record-breaking events and regional anomalies relative
    to independent, identically distributed expectations. Estimate uncertainty
    through temporal shuffling, summarize trends with LOESS or singular
    spectrum analysis, and plot the resulting anomaly series.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    formattable,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    Rssa,
    stats,
    trend,
    utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
